{"id":"139663d62455064c","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-cor-cantors-thm.md","title":"Cantor Theorem","display":"cor-cantors-thm — Cantor Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-cantors-thm","aliases":["58-cor-cantors-thm"],"display":"cor-cantors-thm — Cantor Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-cantors-thm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-cantors-thm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-cantors-thm — Cantor Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\)</span> (一阶 ZFC 对象, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(X)\\)</span> (幂集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|X|\">\\(|X|\\)</span> (基数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cantors-thm} \\vdash \\forall X\\;(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\to |X|&lt;|\\mathcal P(X)|)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cantors-thm} \\vdash \\forall X\\;(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\to |X|&lt;|\\mathcal P(X)|)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cantor's theorem: no surjection from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This holds for all sets, including infinite ones.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)$ (一阶 ZFC 对象, see [[58-df-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{P}(X)$ (幂集, see [[58-df-powerset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|X|$ (基数函数, see [[58-df-cardinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"|X|","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}cantors-thm} \\vdash \\forall X\\;(\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\to |X|<|\\mathcal P(X)|)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(X)","display":false}],"bytes":850,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-cor-cantors-thm.md|58-cor-cantors-thm]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}